WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.950
- Welcome back and once again

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:05.130
a huge salute to all our
veterans in the audience

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.750
and those watching at home.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.300
Our next guest served in
the Army for nine years

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.880
before launching a huge, successful career

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.200
as a country music artist,

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.180
and he continues to be huge supporter

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.900
of service men and women raising
money and doing USO tours.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.750
He has a new album out called "Enlisted"

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.880
featuring duets with a
number of performers,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.090
including Blake Shelton
and I'm just kidding,

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:30.840
and Lainey Wilson, and now
performing "Almost Home"

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.550
featuring Jelly Roll, give it
up for Craig Morgan everybody.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.763
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:36.763 --> 00:00:38.430
- Thank you so much!

00:00:40.336 --> 00:00:42.536
(bright country music)

00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:45.656
♪ He had plastic bags
wrapped 'round his shoes ♪

00:00:45.656 --> 00:00:48.804
♪ He was covered with the evening news ♪

00:00:48.804 --> 00:00:53.804
♪ Had a pair of old wool
socks on his hands ♪

00:00:54.931 --> 00:00:58.224
♪ Bank sign was flashing five below ♪

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:01.227
♪ It was freezing rain an' spittin' snow ♪

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:06.227
♪ He was curled up behind
some garbage cans ♪

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:10.457
♪ I was afraid that he was dead ♪

00:01:10.457 --> 00:01:14.273
♪ I gave him a gentle shake ♪

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:16.575
♪ When he opened up his eyes ♪

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:21.212
♪ I said, old man are you okay ♪

00:01:21.212 --> 00:01:22.518
What'd he say Jelly?

00:01:22.518 --> 00:01:27.518
♪ Just climbed out of a cottonwood tree ♪

00:01:28.652 --> 00:01:33.652
♪ I was runnin' from some honey bees ♪

00:01:33.751 --> 00:01:34.895
- Grand Ole Opry!

00:01:34.895 --> 00:01:39.895
